msgid "Compiling the application into a native executable"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We will reuse the CRUD application developed in a https://quarkus.io/blog/"
"virtual-threads-2/[previous blog post].\n"
"The source code is located in the https://github.com/quarkusio/virtual-"
"threads-demos/tree/main/crud-example[virtual-threads-demos GitHub "
"repository].\n"
"Note that while we are using the CRUD application, the same approach can be "
"used with any Quarkus application leveraging virtual threads, including the "
"other demos from the repository."
